SUMMARY:Wreath Workshop at West Wines in Healdsburg
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nThe Holidays are here
  in Wine Country and we are feeling Crafty!\n\nI have the pleasure of conn
 ecting with A Little Extra Events and Rentals who are offering a workshop 
 at West Wines in Healdsburg.\n\n**Get ready for a hands-on\, creative work
 shop where you'll dive into the art of designing and creating a holiday wr
 eath.**\n\nThere is a maximum of 16 seats available at this time. Your spo
 t is reserved by prepaying for your ticket through EventBrite ticketing an
 d website: [https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2003687680791?aff=oddtdtcreator](
 https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2003687680791?aff=oddtdtcreator "https://www.
 eventbrite.com/e/2003687680791?aff=oddtdtcreator")\n\nThe cost of the even
 t is $56 per person. They provide the materials and guidance creating on w
 reaths\, plus a complimentary glass of wine.\n\nGuests are welcome\, they 
 will need to pre-pay as well. I suggest you wear layers as we might be out
 side\, and sometimes the weather is windy or cold. We will confirm headcou
 nt about a week before\, they will do refunds up to 1 week before.\n\nChee
 rs to this fun crafty event!
